## VI. In-Band Control Message Protocol

Client sends msgpack messages containing a `__ctrl__` key; server recognizes them, calls policy lifecycle methods, and sends ack:

```python
# Client -> Server
{"__ctrl__": "episode_start", "__experiment__": "...", "__task__": "...", "__episode_id__": N}
{"__ctrl__": "episode_end", "__success__": bool}

# Server -> Client (unconditional ack)
{"__ack__": "episode_start"}
{"__ack__": "episode_end"}
```

---

## VII. Usage Example

```bash
# Server
uv run scripts/serve_policy.py \
    --env libero --policy.config pi05_libero \
    --policy.dir checkpoints/pi05_libero/exp/10000 \
    --collect --collect_dir /data/libero_experiments

# Client (main.py internally calls episode_start/end)
uv run examples/libero/main.py --host <server_ip> --task_suite_name libero_spatial
```

